/T (This system consists of building a model using Python/Google Colab and implementing it on a website. The process involves collecting Google Maps reviews, preprocessing, sentiment labeling, TF-IDF feature extraction, and training and evaluating an SVM model. The model is then integrated into the website so that users can enter or upload reviews, view classification results via a graphical dashboard and word cloud, filter results, and export reports in PDF format.)
/E (This system consists of building a model using Python/Google Colab and implementing it on a website. The process involves collecting Google Maps reviews, preprocessing, sentiment labeling, TF-IDF feature extraction, and training and evaluating an SVM model. The model is then integrated into the website so that users can enter or upload reviews, view classification results via a graphical dashboard and word cloud, filter results, and export reports in PDF format.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
